<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</link><description>瑞银集团(UBS Group AG)最高领导层本周致信员工，试图向他们保证，瑞士不断加强监管的努力不会夺走该银行数十年来努力打造的东西——真正的全球业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens'&gt;瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UBS Vows to Remain Global as Swiss Capital Outlook Darkens&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria Studies Deal for Cigarette Maker Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧洲央行官员认为通胀前景更糟，紧缩政策进一步加强</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ecb-officials-saw-more-tightening-with-inflation-outlook-worse</link><description>欧洲央行官员上个月的会议预计，在通胀前景恶化后，未来将进一步收紧货币政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ecb-officials-saw-more-tightening-with-inflation-outlook-worse'&gt;欧洲央行官员认为通胀前景更糟，紧缩政策进一步加强&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：ECB Officials Saw More Tightening With Inflation Outlook Worse&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ecb-officials-saw-more-tightening-with-inflation-outlook-worse</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:09:36 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</link><description>由于土耳其央行准备金大幅下降，交易商正在撤回对土耳其 12 月降息的押注，这引发了人们对政策制定者支持里拉的难度可能加大的担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink'&gt;由于储备减少，土耳其交易员认为降息步伐放缓&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey’s Traders See Slower Rate Cut Pace as Reserves Shrink&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/turkey-s-traders-see-slower-rate-cut-pace-as-reserves-shrink</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据称 Targa 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik 以加强主要管道合作</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up</link><description>据知情人士透露，Targa Resources Corp. 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik Holdings Inc.，这是一家由 Blackstone Inc. 部分拥有的上市管道公司。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up'&gt;据称 Targa 正在洽谈收购 Kinetik 以加强主要管道合作&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Targa Said to Be in Talks to Buy Kinetik in Pipeline Tie-Up&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/targa-is-said-in-talks-to-buy-kinetik-in-major-pipeline-tie-up</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:00:57 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>